","textCenter":"阿什莉！[chara:300401:lipSynch_0][wait:0.8][chara:300401:cheek_0][chara:300401:face_mtn_ex_041.exp.json][chara:300401:lipSynch_1]吓我一跳！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":101301,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"龙城明日香","textLeft":"谢谢你邀请我们参加这个活动。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":305201,"motion":1}],"textRight":"不用谢！你们能对活动感兴趣，@我就已经很开心了！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":305201}],"textRight":"不过……@你们是不是遇到什么问题了？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":101301,"motion":0}],"textLeft":"这个嘛……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":300401,"motion":200}],"textCenter":"不如问问阿什莉吧，@她对穿搭很了解。"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300401},{"id":305201,"motion":0}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"id":101301,"motion":1}],"textLeft":"说得也是……"},{"chara":[{"id":101301}],"textLeft":"是这条花纹裙吸引了我的注意。"},{"chara":[{"id":101301,"motion":300}],"textLeft":"但我不知道自己能不能驾驭，@所以一直犹豫不决。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_041.exp.json","id":300401,"motion":100,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"美凪纱纱罗","textLeft":"我也不擅长穿搭。"},{"chara":[{"id":300401}],"textLeft":"所以给不出什么有用的建议……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":305201,"motion":300}],"textRight":"啊，我明白了。"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305201}],"textRight":"花纹衣料一旦搭错单品，@整套造型就会变成灾难！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp.json","id":101301,"motion":200,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"龙城明日香","textLeft":"果然！"},{"chara":[{"id":101301}],"textLeft":"像我这样的新手，@根本驾驭不了这么有挑战性的单品！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305201,"motion":200}],"textRight":"不是！我不是这个意思！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":305201,"motion":0}],"textRight":"没问题！只要让其他单品收敛一点，@把舞台全都留给这条裙子就好！"},{"chara":[{"id":101301,"motion":100}],"textLeft":"哦哦！"},{"chara":[{"id":101301,"lipSynch":0}],"textLeft":"……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":101301,"motion":0}],"textLeft":"具体要怎么搭？"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":101301}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305201,"motion":1,"pos":1}],"nameNarration":"阿什莉·泰勒","narration":"搭配花纹单品时，@其他部分要尽量选择简洁的款式。@合身的白T恤百搭，@针织衫则能让整体显得更柔和。@夏天也有轻薄的针织衫可以选。","narrationBg":"","narrationCoverOpacity":110,"narrationEffect":"in"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":305201}],"narrationEffect":"out","textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":101301,"motion":200,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":300401,"motion":200,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"龙城明日香","nameRight":"美凪纱纱罗","textLeft":"原、原来如此！我从来都不知道！"},{"chara":[{"id":300401}],"textRight":"哇，一整套已经搭好了！@看起来很棒。"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"id":300401,"pos":0}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"id":300401,"motion":1},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305201,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"美凪纱纱罗","textLeft":"那个，阿什莉……@也能替我挑一套吗？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_041.exp.json","id":300401}],"textLeft":"我很不擅长这种事。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":305201,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"阿什莉·泰勒","textRight":"当然没问题！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":305201}],"textRight":"你的身材很修长，@穿长裤一定很好看！"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300401}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"id":305201,"motion":300,"pos":1}],"nameNarration":"阿什莉·泰勒","narration":"我想想……有了！@白色长裤一定很适合你！@上衣就选大胆一点的颜色。@嗯……再加条细腰带@当作点缀应该不错……","narrationBg":"","narrationCoverOpacity":110,"narrationEffect":"in"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"id":305201,"pos":2}],"narrationEffect":"out","textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":800700,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"","nameRight":"阿什莉·泰勒","textLeft":"在找腰带吗？这里有条不错的。"},{"chara":[{"id":305201,"motion":400}],"textRight":"哦！让我看看！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":800700}],"textLeft":"请在那里稍等一下。"},{"chara":[{"id":